# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CircuitStudio / Altium Designer
#
# Tracked: the design sources (.PrjPcb, .SchDoc, .CSPcbDoc, .OutJob) and the
# released manufacturing package under "Default Configuration/Outputs/".
# Ignored: everything CircuitStudio regenerates or that only describes this
# machine.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local backup snapshots and logs written by CircuitStudio
History/
__Previews/
Logs/
Project Logs*/
*.PrjPcbStructure
*.Dat

# Per-output run state - records local absolute paths, no design value
*.OutputStatus
Status Report.Txt

# Editor and tool scratch files
*.~(*)*
*.bak
*.tmp
*.$$$
~$*

# OS clutter
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
